  "answer": "The features not supported on TPU hardware are:\n\n- **FP8 (W8A8)**: ❌  \n- **AWQ**: ❌  \n- **FP4 (W4A8)**: ❌  \n- **INT8 (W8A8)**: ✅  \n\nThese features are not supported on TPU hardware."
